   │  ├─ into: turtle/feat-wave-report
   │  ├─ behind: 1 commit
   │  │  └─ HASH123 feat(docs): the main change
   │  └─ ahead: 1 commit
   ├─ commit
   │  ├─ header: cont(branch): merge origin/main into turtle/feat-wave-report
   │  ├─ author: seaturtle[bot] <seaturtle@ehmpath.com>
   │  └─ sponsor: Test Human <human@test.com>, from bound (this tree)
   └─ meter
      └─ left: 4 → 3

run with --mode apply to execute
"
`;

